1: /**
2:  * PSC WDB — LINE Reports to Google Sheets Web App (Standalone + Gemini AI)
3:  *
4:  * Install this file in the Apps Script project attached to the target Google Sheet:
5:  * "PSC WDB LINE Sync Database"
6:  *
7:  * Required Script Properties (Project Settings -> Script Properties):
8:  *   GEMINI_API_KEY            = AIzaSy... (Free API key from Google AI Studio)
9:  *   LINE_CHANNEL_ACCESS_TOKEN = ... (Channel Access Token from LINE Developers Console)
10:  *   PSC_SYNC_TOKEN            = ... (Optional shared token for relay sync)
11:  *   LINE_ADMIN_USER_ID        = U... (Optional; admin LINE user ID for group-message push notifications)
12:  *
13:  * Deployment:
14:  *   Execute as: Me
15:  *   Who has access: Anyone
16:  *
17:  * โครงสร้างไฟล์ (บนลงล่าง):
18:  *   1. Config
19:  *   2. Entry points (doGet / doPost)
20:  *   3. LINE event handlers (ข้อความ / รูปภาพ)
21:  *   4. Gemini AI (แปลงข้อความ/รูปเป็น JSON)
22:  *   5. Sync ไปยัง Sheet ปลายทางอื่น (Farm Ops / Prices / Customer POs)
23:  *   6. LINE messaging (reply / push)
24:  *   7. Utilities ทั่วไป
25:  *   8. Setup / one-off tools
26:  */
27: 
28: // ===================== 1. CONFIG =====================
29: 
